Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.16,0:00:05.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,what you could not finish.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:05.46,0:00:08.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Pray Psalm twenty-three with me now.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:09.25,0:00:11.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will walk through Psalm
Dialogue: 4,0:00:11.18,0:00:13.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,twenty-three line by line,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:13.10,0:00:14.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,praying over your needs,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:14.88,0:00:16.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,your regrets, your grief,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:16.74,0:00:18.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:18.00,0:00:19.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then gentle readings will
Dialogue: 4,0:00:19.96,0:00:22.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,carry you toward sleep.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:22.86,0:00:25.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you have reached your pillow
Dialogue: 4,0:00:25.52,0:00:28.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,with a conversation still unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:00:28.19,0:00:29.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a task still
Dialogue: 4,0:00:29.30,0:00:31.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,turning in your mind.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:31.16,0:00:34.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can bring that unfinished day here.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:34.36,0:00:36.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your shoulders settle
Dialogue: 4,0:00:36.19,0:00:38.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,as comfortably as they can.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:38.48,0:00:40.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,You do not have to arrange
Dialogue: 4,0:00:40.48,0:00:43.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,a perfect ending before you pray.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:43.32,0:00:46.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,We will walk through Psalm twenty three,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,one verse at a time,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:47.58,0:00:49.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,beginning with the One
Dialogue: 4,0:00:49.14,0:00:50.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,who cares for you.
Dialogue: 5,0:00:51.92,0:00:54.23,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}The LORD is my shepherd;
Dialogue: 5,0:00:54.23,0:00:56.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I shall not want.
Dialogue: 4,0:00:57.74,0:00:58.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:00:58.10,0:00:59.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have come to the end
Dialogue: 4,0:00:59.72,0:01:01.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,of what I can do today.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:01.70,0:01:03.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the messages
Dialogue: 4,0:01:03.27,0:01:04.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,I could not answer,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:04.75,0:01:06.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work I could not finish,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:06.94,0:01:09.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the needs I could not meet.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive me here,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:11.02,0:01:13.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,with no polished explanation.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:13.78,0:01:16.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,I want to know your care more
Dialogue: 4,0:01:16.13,0:01:19.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,deeply than I know my own worry.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:19.03,0:01:21.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Be my Shepherd in this quiet hour,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:21.58,0:01:22.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,and teach me how
Dialogue: 4,0:01:22.79,0:01:25.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,to receive rest from you.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:26.16,0:01:27.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,You may have spent today
Dialogue: 4,0:01:27.92,0:01:30.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,being useful to other people.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:30.34,0:01:32.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,You answered, arranged, carried,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:32.81,0:01:33.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,remembered.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:33.95,0:01:35.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yet the first verse gives
Dialogue: 4,0:01:35.81,0:01:37.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,you an identity that comes
Dialogue: 4,0:01:37.75,0:01:40.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,before all of those things.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:40.06,0:01:42.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,You belong to a Shepherd.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:42.28,0:01:45.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Your place with him does not disappear
Dialogue: 4,0:01:45.14,0:01:47.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,when your energy is spent.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:47.40,0:01:48.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,As you listen,
Dialogue: 4,0:01:48.46,0:01:50.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can stop measuring this day
Dialogue: 4,0:01:50.81,0:01:53.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,only by what you accomplished.
Dialogue: 4,0:01:53.39,0:01:55.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also remember whose care
Dialogue: 4,0:01:55.53,0:01:57.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,has accompanied you through it.
Dialogue: 5,0:01:59.10,0:02:01.34,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}I am the good shepherd:
Dialogue: 5,0:02:01.34,0:02:02.94,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the good shepherd giveth
Dialogue: 5,0:02:02.94,0:02:04.82,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}his life for the sheep.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.27,0:02:06.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:06.84,0:02:10.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my practical needs before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:10.24,0:02:12.77,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the household expenses,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:12.77,0:02:14.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,the work I am seeking,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:14.56,0:02:16.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the decisions about
Dialogue: 4,0:02:16.43,0:02:18.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I can afford.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:18.20,0:02:21.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me wisdom to distinguish a genuine
Dialogue: 4,0:02:21.32,0:02:24.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,need from the pressure to keep up.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:24.34,0:02:26.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me to ask for assistance
Dialogue: 4,0:02:26.39,0:02:28.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,where I need it and to use
Dialogue: 4,0:02:28.22,0:02:30.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,what I have carefully.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:30.06,0:02:32.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for daily provision,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:32.13,0:02:33.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,honest opportunities,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:33.80,0:02:35.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,and a heart that can
Dialogue: 4,0:02:35.39,0:02:37.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive help without shame.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.03,0:02:39.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:39.42,0:02:41.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,when I compare my life
Dialogue: 4,0:02:41.12,0:02:42.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,with someone else's,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:42.66,0:02:44.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,I lose sight of the gifts
Dialogue: 4,0:02:44.59,0:02:46.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,already beside me.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:46.28,0:02:49.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight I lay down that comparison.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:49.53,0:02:51.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not know their whole story,
Dialogue: 4,0:02:51.94,0:02:54.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I cannot live their calling.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:54.65,0:02:56.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize the portion
Dialogue: 4,0:02:56.97,0:02:59.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,entrusted to me today.
Dialogue: 4,0:02:59.02,0:03:01.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let gratitude grow without
Dialogue: 4,0:03:01.19,0:03:03.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,denying anything difficult.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:03.74,0:03:05.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I have enough,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:05.19,0:03:06.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,make me generous.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:06.73,0:03:08.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Where I am lacking,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:08.20,0:03:09.91,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me speak honestly
Dialogue: 4,0:03:09.91,0:03:11.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,and seek wise support.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:13.12,0:03:16.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next comes the line about still waters,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:16.10,0:03:18.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the work you are ready
Dialogue: 4,0:03:18.08,0:03:19.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,to put down.
Dialogue: 5,0:03:19.90,0:03:21.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He maketh me to lie
Dialogue: 5,0:03:21.48,0:03:23.68,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}down in green pastures:
Dialogue: 5,0:03:23.68,0:03:27.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me beside the still waters.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:28.49,0:03:30.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd of my life,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:30.14,0:03:31.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,I set down the tools
Dialogue: 4,0:03:31.79,0:03:33.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,of this day.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:33.08,0:03:35.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the screen, the list,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:35.52,0:03:36.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,the calculations,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:36.85,0:03:39.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the words I keep rehearsing.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:39.67,0:03:41.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me the humility to stop
Dialogue: 4,0:03:41.65,0:03:43.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,when my strength is spent.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:43.79,0:03:46.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,If something needs attention tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:46.53,0:03:47.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me return to it
Dialogue: 4,0:03:47.98,0:03:49.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,with wisdom then.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:49.51,0:03:50.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,For this hour,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:50.69,0:03:53.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my work before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:03:53.26,0:03:55.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my hands become quiet,
Dialogue: 4,0:03:55.41,0:03:57.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,and let my mind step away
Dialogue: 4,0:03:57.47,0:03:59.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,from the unfinished page.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.04,0:04:01.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:01.53,0:04:03.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,I release the wish that this
Dialogue: 4,0:04:03.53,0:04:05.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,evening had gone differently.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:05.90,0:04:08.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,Perhaps I hoped for a calmer home,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:08.81,0:04:09.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,more time,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:09.67,0:04:12.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,or a kinder conversation.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:12.11,0:04:15.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the evening I actually have.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:15.22,0:04:17.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Meet me among the ordinary
Dialogue: 4,0:04:17.24,0:04:18.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,sounds around me,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:18.55,0:04:20.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,the light beneath the door,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:20.64,0:04:23.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the things still out of place.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:23.57,0:04:25.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a little room inside
Dialogue: 4,0:04:25.88,0:04:29.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,my thoughts to remember your presence.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:29.12,0:04:31.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive this moment without
Dialogue: 4,0:04:31.68,0:04:34.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,demanding that it be perfect.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:35.31,0:04:36.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,For a moment,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:36.36,0:04:38.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,leave the list alone.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:38.36,0:04:39.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe naturally,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,without trying to reach
Dialogue: 4,0:04:41.46,0:04:43.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,a particular rhythm.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:43.27,0:04:46.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Notice where you are supported.
Dialogue: 4,0:04:46.13,0:04:47.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let your next breath
Dialogue: 4,0:04:47.50,0:04:49.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,arrive in its own time,
Dialogue: 4,0:04:49.08,0:04:51.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,while this simple prayer settles:
Dialogue: 4,0:04:51.64,0:04:54.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd, lead me into rest.
Dialogue: 5,0:04:56.13,0:04:58.56,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He restoreth my soul:
Dialogue: 5,0:04:58.56,0:05:00.61,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he leadeth me in the paths
Dialogue: 5,0:05:00.61,0:05:03.86,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of righteousness for his name's sake.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.32,0:05:05.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:05.72,0:05:08.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name what needs forgiveness in me.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:08.92,0:05:11.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember the sharp answer,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:11.10,0:05:12.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,the selfish choice,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the truth I avoided.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:14.75,0:05:15.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am sorry
Dialogue: 4,0:05:15.61,0:05:17.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,for the hurt I caused.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:17.80,0:05:18.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Forgive me,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:18.59,0:05:19.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and make me willing
Dialogue: 4,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,to repair what I can.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:21.75,0:05:23.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me distinguish honest
Dialogue: 4,0:05:23.82,0:05:25.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,responsibility from endless
Dialogue: 4,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,self-accusation.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:27.55,0:05:29.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot undo this
Dialogue: 4,0:05:29.09,0:05:31.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,day by replaying it.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:31.09,0:05:33.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can bring it to your mercy
Dialogue: 4,0:05:33.20,0:05:35.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,and ask you to shape a more
Dialogue: 4,0:05:35.23,0:05:37.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,faithful response tomorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:38.76,0:05:41.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Guide my next step, Lord.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:41.36,0:05:43.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,If an apology is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:43.42,0:05:45.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me offer it plainly.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:45.86,0:05:47.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,If a boundary is needed,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:47.66,0:05:50.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me speak it with steadiness.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:50.43,0:05:51.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,If I need to finish
Dialogue: 4,0:05:51.87,0:05:53.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,something I have avoided,
Dialogue: 4,0:05:53.76,0:05:55.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,give me courage to begin.
Dialogue: 4,0:05:55.96,0:05:58.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me from making grand promises
Dialogue: 4,0:05:58.59,0:06:01.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,tonight that I have not considered.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:01.59,0:06:03.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me the quiet faithfulness
Dialogue: 4,0:06:03.85,0:06:05.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,of doing one right
Dialogue: 4,0:06:05.16,0:06:06.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,thing at a time,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:06.32,0:06:09.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,following the path you place before me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:10.66,0:06:12.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:12.33,0:06:14.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,Soon we reach the valley,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:14.18,0:06:16.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you will not walk it alone.
Dialogue: 5,0:06:17.37,0:06:19.03,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}He shall feed his flock
Dialogue: 5,0:06:19.03,0:06:20.48,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}like a shepherd:
Dialogue: 5,0:06:20.48,0:06:21.58,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}he shall gather
Dialogue: 5,0:06:21.58,0:06:23.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}the lambs with his arm,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:23.26,0:06:25.31,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and carry them in his bosom,
Dialogue: 5,0:06:25.31,0:06:26.84,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and shall gently lead
Dialogue: 5,0:06:26.84,0:06:29.09,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}those that are with young.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:30.54,0:06:31.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,Gentle Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:31.74,0:06:33.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the people who depend
Dialogue: 4,0:06:33.93,0:06:35.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,on me and the weariness
Dialogue: 4,0:06:35.66,0:06:37.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,I sometimes hide from them.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:37.99,0:06:39.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me love them without
Dialogue: 4,0:06:39.78,0:06:42.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,pretending my strength is endless.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:42.51,0:06:44.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me where I can
Dialogue: 4,0:06:44.04,0:06:45.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,share a task,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:45.09,0:06:46.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,ask a friend,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:46.14,0:06:49.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,or accept another person's kindness.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:49.34,0:06:51.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I feel guilty for resting,
Dialogue: 4,0:06:51.84,0:06:53.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,remind me that I am also
Dialogue: 4,0:06:53.78,0:06:56.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,a creature in need of care.
Dialogue: 4,0:06:56.25,0:06:58.53,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me receive tenderness as
Dialogue: 4,0:06:58.53,0:07:01.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,readily as I try to offer it.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.38,0:07:02.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,Yea,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:02.67,0:07:05.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,though I walk through the valley
Dialogue: 4,0:07:05.00,0:07:06.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the shadow of death,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:06.67,0:07:08.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will fear no evil:
Dialogue: 5,0:07:08.42,0:07:10.81,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for thou art with me;
Dialogue: 5,0:07:10.81,0:07:12.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thy rod and thy staff
Dialogue: 5,0:07:12.57,0:07:14.26,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}they comfort me.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:15.70,0:07:16.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:16.07,0:07:18.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the sorrow that feels
Dialogue: 4,0:07:18.22,0:07:21.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,sharper when the house grows quiet.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:21.10,0:07:23.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the person I miss,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:23.16,0:07:25.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,the change I did not choose,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:25.37,0:07:28.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the future that now looks different.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:28.83,0:07:31.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,Stay near as I grieve.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:31.20,0:07:33.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,I will not force a cheerful
Dialogue: 4,0:07:33.40,0:07:35.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,ending onto a painful day.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:35.83,0:07:37.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive the tears I have,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:37.94,0:07:40.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the words I cannot find.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:40.61,0:07:42.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me accept companionship
Dialogue: 4,0:07:42.63,0:07:44.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,from people who can sit with me
Dialogue: 4,0:07:44.87,0:07:47.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,without rushing my sorrow.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.25,0:07:48.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:07:48.82,0:07:50.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the unknown
Dialogue: 4,0:07:50.37,0:07:52.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,that follows me into bed.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:52.71,0:07:55.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot see how the conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:07:55.34,0:07:57.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,will go or what the next
Dialogue: 4,0:07:57.26,0:07:59.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,season will require.
Dialogue: 4,0:07:59.16,0:08:01.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me courage for the part
Dialogue: 4,0:08:01.16,0:08:02.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,that belongs to me,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:02.51,0:08:05.60,Caption,,0,0,0,,and patience with what remains unclear.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:05.60,0:08:07.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,Keep me attentive to wise
Dialogue: 4,0:08:07.58,0:08:10.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,counsel and practical help.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.02,0:08:10.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,For tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:10.94,0:08:12.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask you to meet me
Dialogue: 4,0:08:12.49,0:08:14.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the uncertainty itself.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:14.80,0:08:16.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let me remember that I can
Dialogue: 4,0:08:16.59,0:08:18.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,speak to you from here.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:19.67,0:08:20.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:20.29,0:08:21.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,I remember those I love
Dialogue: 4,0:08:21.88,0:08:23.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,who are walking through
Dialogue: 4,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,their own valleys.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:25.02,0:08:27.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot choose their steps
Dialogue: 4,0:08:27.34,0:08:29.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,or remove every difficulty.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:29.95,0:08:31.65,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can bring their names
Dialogue: 4,0:08:31.65,0:08:33.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,before you with love.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:33.50,0:08:35.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give them faithful companions
Dialogue: 4,0:08:35.75,0:08:37.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the help their
Dialogue: 4,0:08:37.14,0:08:39.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,circumstances require.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:39.15,0:08:42.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,Teach me to listen before I advise.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:42.44,0:08:44.24,Caption,,0,0,0,,Show me a kindness I can
Dialogue: 4,0:08:44.24,0:08:46.49,Caption,,0,0,0,,offer when the day begins.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:46.49,0:08:47.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,As I rest now,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:47.64,0:08:50.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust them to your compassion,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:50.43,0:08:53.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,with all that remains beyond my reach.
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.05,0:08:55.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,Next,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:55.42,0:08:57.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,the table prepared for you,
Dialogue: 4,0:08:57.38,0:08:59.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the argument you keep
Dialogue: 4,0:08:59.19,0:09:00.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,having in your head.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:01.54,0:09:04.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thou preparest a table before me
Dialogue: 4,0:09:04.14,0:09:07.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the presence of mine enemies:
Dialogue: 5,0:09:07.03,0:09:10.04,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}thou anointest my head with oil;
Dialogue: 4,0:09:10.04,0:09:12.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,my cup runneth over.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:13.71,0:09:14.12,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:14.12,0:09:16.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the argument I keep
Dialogue: 4,0:09:16.32,0:09:18.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,conducting in my head.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:18.41,0:09:21.67,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have imagined my answers many times,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:21.67,0:09:23.25,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I am tired.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:23.25,0:09:25.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me surrender the urge
Dialogue: 4,0:09:25.03,0:09:26.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,to win it again tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:26.96,0:09:29.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,Give me wisdom about any conversation
Dialogue: 4,0:09:29.73,0:09:32.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,that still needs to happen.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:32.04,0:09:33.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,Protect me from cruelty,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:33.82,0:09:37.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,and help me keep appropriate boundaries.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:37.08,0:09:39.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask for a heart that can
Dialogue: 4,0:09:39.09,0:09:41.33,Caption,,0,0,0,,seek peace without pretending
Dialogue: 4,0:09:41.33,0:09:42.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,harm is harmless.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:42.95,0:09:44.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let the rehearsed speeches
Dialogue: 4,0:09:44.84,0:09:46.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,become quiet now.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:47.58,0:09:48.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:48.14,0:09:50.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,I pause over a particular
Dialogue: 4,0:09:50.10,0:09:52.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,kindness from this day.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:52.22,0:09:53.48,Caption,,0,0,0,,A meal prepared,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:53.48,0:09:54.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,a message received,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:54.98,0:09:56.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,a moment of laughter,
Dialogue: 4,0:09:56.63,0:09:59.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,or someone making room for me.
Dialogue: 4,0:09:59.30,0:10:01.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,I name the gift I remember.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:01.99,0:10:03.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the person
Dialogue: 4,0:10:03.56,0:10:05.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,through whom it came.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:05.23,0:10:08.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me notice ordinary provision while
Dialogue: 4,0:10:08.26,0:10:11.66,Caption,,0,0,0,,I still live among unanswered questions.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:11.66,0:10:13.34,Caption,,0,0,0,,I receive this small
Dialogue: 4,0:10:13.34,0:10:15.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,mercy with gratitude.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:15.41,0:10:18.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let it occupy a little more space
Dialogue: 4,0:10:18.04,0:10:20.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,in my memory than it did before.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.10,0:10:22.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:22.47,0:10:24.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,let what I receive become
Dialogue: 4,0:10:24.37,0:10:26.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,kindness in my hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:26.26,0:10:28.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I have patience to spare,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:28.57,0:10:30.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me offer it.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:30.18,0:10:32.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I have enough to share,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:32.26,0:10:34.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,help me notice a real need.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:34.56,0:10:36.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,When I have been forgiven,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:36.39,0:10:37.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,soften the way I speak
Dialogue: 4,0:10:37.93,0:10:40.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,to someone who has failed.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:40.06,0:10:42.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,I do not want abundance to mean
Dialogue: 4,0:10:42.42,0:10:45.08,Caption,,0,0,0,,only gathering more for myself.
Dialogue: 4,0:10:45.08,0:10:47.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,Form in me a generous life,
Dialogue: 4,0:10:47.22,0:10:49.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,with room for my neighbor
Dialogue: 4,0:10:49.21,0:10:50.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,at the table.
Dialogue: 5,0:10:51.74,0:10:54.29,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Surely goodness and mercy shall
Dialogue: 5,0:10:54.29,0:10:55.69,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}follow me all the
Dialogue: 5,0:10:55.69,0:10:57.31,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}days of my life:
Dialogue: 5,0:10:57.31,0:10:59.44,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will dwell in the house
Dialogue: 5,0:10:59.44,0:11:01.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}of the LORD for ever.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:02.78,0:11:03.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,Faithful Lord,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:03.90,0:11:06.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place tomorrow within your care.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:06.92,0:11:09.89,Caption,,0,0,0,,I cannot prepare for every possibility,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:09.89,0:11:11.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and I do not need to finish
Dialogue: 4,0:11:11.94,0:11:14.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,tomorrow's prayers tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:14.30,0:11:15.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,When morning comes,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:15.71,0:11:18.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,guide the work and the relationships
Dialogue: 4,0:11:18.38,0:11:19.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,waiting there.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:19.72,0:11:21.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me recognize goodness,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:21.88,0:11:23.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,receive mercy,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:23.01,0:11:25.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,and offer both to others.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:25.31,0:11:27.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust the remaining
Dialogue: 4,0:11:27.01,0:11:29.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,hours of this night to you.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:29.30,0:11:30.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let my life become
Dialogue: 4,0:11:30.72,0:11:32.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,a place where I learn,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:32.46,0:11:33.32,Caption,,0,0,0,,day by day,
Dialogue: 4,0:11:33.32,0:11:35.09,Caption,,0,0,0,,to dwell with you.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:36.24,0:11:37.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,We are near the end
Dialogue: 4,0:11:37.72,0:11:39.04,Caption,,0,0,0,,of the psalm.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:39.04,0:11:41.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,Say these words of trust with me.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:42.48,0:11:45.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,I belong to the good Shepherd.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:45.02,0:11:48.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can bring him a genuine need.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:48.07,0:11:49.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can receive rest without
Dialogue: 4,0:11:49.99,0:11:52.51,Caption,,0,0,0,,earning it through exhaustion.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:52.51,0:11:55.45,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can return when I have wandered.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:55.45,0:11:56.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can speak to him
Dialogue: 4,0:11:56.88,0:11:58.29,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the valley.
Dialogue: 4,0:11:58.29,0:12:00.15,Caption,,0,0,0,,I can receive kindness
Dialogue: 4,0:12:00.15,0:12:02.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,while questions remain.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:02.39,0:12:04.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place the day behind me
Dialogue: 4,0:12:04.35,0:12:05.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the day before
Dialogue: 4,0:12:05.76,0:12:07.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,me within his care.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:07.55,0:12:08.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Tonight,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:08.14,0:12:10.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,I am learning to trust him
Dialogue: 4,0:12:10.06,0:12:12.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,with what I cannot carry.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:13.40,0:12:15.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,Choose one unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:12:15.13,0:12:16.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,concern from today.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:16.99,0:12:18.19,Caption,,0,0,0,,Name it simply,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:18.19,0:12:21.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,without opening the whole story again.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:21.54,0:12:23.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Then pray:
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.14,0:12:23.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:23.78,0:12:25.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place this in your care
Dialogue: 4,0:12:25.57,0:12:26.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,for tonight.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:26.72,0:12:29.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,If a practical step belongs to tomorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:29.86,0:12:33.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can take it when tomorrow arrives.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.14,0:12:33.78,Caption,,0,0,0,,For now,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:33.78,0:12:35.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,let that one concern rest
Dialogue: 4,0:12:35.76,0:12:37.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,beside this one prayer.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:37.88,0:12:39.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,You have given it a name,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:39.56,0:12:41.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,and you have brought it to God.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.40,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you would like
Dialogue: 4,0:12:44.40,0:12:45.88,Caption,,0,0,0,,to mark that prayer,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:45.88,0:12:48.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,you can type amen in the comments.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:48.71,0:12:49.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can also leave
Dialogue: 4,0:12:49.96,0:12:51.57,Caption,,0,0,0,,a prayer request there,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:51.57,0:12:53.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,and in our next night prayer we
Dialogue: 4,0:12:53.73,0:12:56.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,will pray over the requests you share.
Dialogue: 4,0:12:56.69,0:12:59.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,We now move into Scripture for sleep,
Dialogue: 4,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,with gentle readings about
Dialogue: 4,0:13:01.38,0:13:03.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,the Shepherd's care.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:04.17,0:13:06.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can leave the screen alone now
Dialogue: 4,0:13:06.59,0:13:09.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,and listen with your eyes resting,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:09.00,0:13:10.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,if that is comfortable.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:10.94,0:13:12.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,There is nothing you need
Dialogue: 4,0:13:12.73,0:13:14.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,to remember for a test
Dialogue: 4,0:13:14.31,0:13:16.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,or prepare to say afterward.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:16.61,0:13:18.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,The words can arrive
Dialogue: 4,0:13:18.16,0:13:20.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,one passage at a time.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:20.16,0:13:22.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,If your attention wanders,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:22.42,0:13:23.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,return gently.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:23.93,0:13:25.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,If you remain awake,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:25.52,0:13:27.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have not failed.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:27.41,0:13:29.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,This is simply a quiet place
Dialogue: 4,0:13:29.43,0:13:31.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,to rest with Scripture.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:32.88,0:13:33.83,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Come unto me,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:33.83,0:13:35.14,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}all ye that labour
Dialogue: 5,0:13:35.14,0:13:36.60,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and are heavy laden,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:36.60,0:13:38.73,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and I will give you rest.
Dialogue: 5,0:13:38.73,0:13:40.57,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}Take my yoke upon you,
Dialogue: 5,0:13:40.57,0:13:42.21,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and learn of me;
Dialogue: 5,0:13:42.21,0:13:43.33,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}for I am meek
Dialogue: 5,0:13:43.33,0:13:45.28,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and lowly in heart:
Dialogue: 5,0:13:45.28,0:13:46.63,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}and ye shall find
Dialogue: 5,0:13:46.63,0:13:48.59,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}rest unto your souls.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:48.59,0:13:50.30,Caption,,0,0,0,,For my yoke is easy,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:50.30,0:13:52.61,Caption,,0,0,0,,and my burden is light.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.06,0:13:54.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,Jesus,
Dialogue: 4,0:13:54.50,0:13:56.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,I bring the burden of trying
Dialogue: 4,0:13:56.56,0:13:59.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,to prove that I have done enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:13:59.28,0:14:00.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,I ask you to teach
Dialogue: 4,0:14:00.82,0:14:02.74,Caption,,0,0,0,,me your gentle way.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:02.74,0:14:04.63,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive the rest
Dialogue: 4,0:14:04.63,0:14:06.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,you offer to my soul.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:06.58,0:14:08.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave my unfinished
Dialogue: 4,0:14:08.43,0:14:10.83,Caption,,0,0,0,,explanations before you.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:10.83,0:14:12.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,I place my need
Dialogue: 4,0:14:12.00,0:14:14.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,to be understood in your hands.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:14.72,0:14:17.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,Let this quiet time become a small
Dialogue: 4,0:14:17.17,0:14:19.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,practice of trusting your goodness,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:19.69,0:14:20.92,Caption,,0,0,0,,with the strength
Dialogue: 4,0:14:20.92,0:14:23.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,and attention I have tonight.
Dialogue: 5,0:14:24.81,0:14:27.61,Verse,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,470)}For thus saith the Lord GOD;
Dialogue: 4,0:14:27.61,0:14:29.07,Caption,,0,0,0,,Behold, I, even I,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:29.07,0:14:31.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,will both search my sheep,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:31.18,0:14:32.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and seek them out.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:32.94,0:14:35.27,Caption,,0,0,0,,As a shepherd seeketh out his flock
Dialogue: 4,0:14:35.27,0:14:37.06,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the day that he is among
Dialogue: 4,0:14:37.06,0:14:39.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,his sheep that are scattered;
Dialogue: 4,0:14:39.28,0:14:41.16,Caption,,0,0,0,,so will I seek out my sheep,
Dialogue: 4,0:14:41.16,0:14:43.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,and will deliver them out of all
Dialogue: 4,0:14:43.31,0:14:45.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,places where they have been scattered
Dialogue: 4,0:14:45.79,0:14:47.95,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the cloudy and dark day.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:49.40,0:14:51.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,Allow a little space between
Dialogue: 4,0:14:51.38,0:14:53.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,one thought and the next.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:53.46,0:14:55.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,You can feel the pillow beneath
Dialogue: 4,0:14:55.72,0:14:58.28,Caption,,0,0,0,,you without adjusting anything.
Dialogue: 4,0:14:58.28,0:15:01.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,Breathe in your ordinary way.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:01.05,0:15:02.73,Caption,,0,0,0,,For these few moments,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:02.73,0:15:04.99,Caption,,0,0,0,,let being here be enough.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:07.94,0:15:08.87,Caption,,0,0,0,,My Shepherd,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:08.87,0:15:11.50,Caption,,0,0,0,,I leave this day with you now.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:11.50,0:15:12.98,Caption,,0,0,0,,Receive the gratitude,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:12.98,0:15:14.79,Caption,,0,0,0,,the confession, the sorrow,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:14.79,0:15:16.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the hope I have brought.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:16.96,0:15:18.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,Grant me rest,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:18.03,0:15:19.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and meet me with patience
Dialogue: 4,0:15:19.94,0:15:21.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,if I am still awake.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:21.76,0:15:23.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,Help me receive the care
Dialogue: 4,0:15:23.56,0:15:25.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,available to me.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:25.05,0:15:26.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,I entrust the next breath
Dialogue: 4,0:15:26.90,0:15:29.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,and the coming morning to your mercy.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:29.94,0:15:31.37,Caption,,0,0,0,,I have no further
Dialogue: 4,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,words I need to add.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:33.35,0:15:34.43,Caption,,0,0,0,,I rest before
Dialogue: 4,0:15:34.43,0:15:36.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,you in the name of Jesus.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:36.81,0:15:38.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,Amen.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:39.80,0:15:42.05,Caption,,0,0,0,,May the gentleness of the good
Dialogue: 4,0:15:42.05,0:15:44.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Shepherd accompany your rest.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:44.52,0:15:47.20,Caption,,0,0,0,,May his mercy quiet the harsh words
Dialogue: 4,0:15:47.20,0:15:50.03,Caption,,0,0,0,,you have spoken against yourself.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:50.03,0:15:52.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,May his presence be your comfort
Dialogue: 4,0:15:52.44,0:15:54.17,Caption,,0,0,0,,in the hours ahead.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:54.17,0:15:56.36,Caption,,0,0,0,,The prayer is complete.
Dialogue: 4,0:15:56.36,0:15:57.14,Caption,,0,0,0,,Rest here,
Dialogue: 4,0:15:57.14,0:16:00.26,Caption,,0,0,0,,with this day entrusted to his care.
